4. Relationship Between Node, State, and Orchestration

Imagine a school.

Students

These are the Nodes.

Each student performs one task.

School Record Book

This is the State.

It stores:

Name
Roll number
Marks
Attendance

Every teacher updates the same record book.

Principal

The principal decides:

Who teaches first?
Who teaches next?
Which class goes where?

The principal is the Orchestrator.

